    66→    1. Project se3.yaml claude_commands (if present, replaces global)
    67→    2. Global ~/.se3/config.yaml claude_commands
    68→    3. Default: [{cmd: "claude", priority: 0}]
    69→
    70→    Returns list sorted by priority descending, then list order.
    71→    """
    72→    global_cfg = load_global_config()
